                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 4+, set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12&quot; of a battlefield edge and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
