              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">
Add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** units that target an enemy unit that is contesting an objective you do not control.                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
